  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **`IInterprocessObject<T>` implements the async condition waits** Compze.Threading 0.11.0-alpha adds to `IAwaitableShared<T>`: `ReadWhenAsync`, `UpdateWhenAsync`, `TryUpdateWhenAsync`, `TryAwaitAsync` and `AwaitAsync`. They hold no thread while they wait, and like the synchronous waits they load the object for each evaluation of the condition and save it after an update.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Internals.SystemCE 0.7.0-internal (was 0.4.0-internal), Compze.Threading 0.11.0-alpha (was 0.9.0-alpha), Compze.Threading.Interprocess 0.6.0-alpha (was 0.5.1-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
